      "at": "2026-11-16T07:52:40.440Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't place an order. The store couldn't confirm that any dock under $150 runs two 4K 60 Hz displays from a USB-C port.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo ($129.00):** This is the only realistic candidate. It passed the USB-C port check and has two video outputs. The store hasn't listed how many 4K 60 Hz displays it supports, so the two-display check came back \"unknown\". I won't guess that it works.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite ($89.00):** It doesn't fit. It supports only one 4K 60 Hz display.\n- **Demo Dock Travel ($39.00) and Demo Dock Solo ($59.00):** Neither fits. Each has one video output and supports one 4K 60 Hz display.\n\n**The missing spec is the maximum number of 4K 60 Hz displays for the Demo Dock Duo.** If the store adds it, I can re-check the dock and get you a quote.\n\nThe store only showed me products up to $150. I don't know whether a suitable dock exists above that, so raising your budget might help, but I can't promise it would."
    }
