      "text": "I can't quote a dock for this setup. None of the docks under $150 is confirmed to run two displays at 4K 60 Hz on a USB-C (DisplayPort Alt Mode) port, so I haven't created a quote or an order.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo (OAW-DOCK-04), $129.00:** I can't confirm it fits. The USB-C host port check passed. The store hasn't filled in its maximum number of 4K 60 Hz displays, so the two-display check came back \"unknown\". It has two video outputs and 90 W power delivery, but I won't guess that it can run both displays at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite (OAW-DOCK-03), $89.00:** It's incompatible. The port check passed, but the dock supports only 1 display at 4K 60 Hz and you need 2.\n- **Demo Dock Travel (OAW-DOCK-01), $39.00, and Demo Dock Solo (OAW-DOCK-02), $59.00:** Each has a single video output and supports 1 display at 4K 60 Hz, so neither can drive two. I didn't run the compatibility check on these two. I'm going by the store's listed specs.\n\nThe store's whole range within your budget is these four docks. If the store fills in the 4K 60 Hz display spec for the Demo Dock Duo, I can re-check it and quote it. You could also raise your budget, but I can only see products priced up to $150, so I don't know whether a suitable dock exists above that.",
